#: src/js/employment.js:42
msgctxt "tree:copy#/lead"
msgid ""
"Browse twenty-one vacancies, read the conditions, and send an odd résumé. "
"You can also add your whereabouts to the graduate survey."
msgstr "比較二十一項職缺與條款，送出一份奇妙履歷，也可填寫畢業生去向調查。"

